# =============================================================================
# NEVER COMMIT REAL VALUES. This chart is public. Real domains, ACME contact
# emails, registry credentials, and generated passwords belong in a
# gitignored *.local.yaml file, not in this tree. See README.md, "Setting
# real values locally". The patterns below cover the canonical filename and
# the obvious ways to mistype it; if you invent a new name for your local
# file, it will NOT be ignored automatically, so keep to one of these.
# =============================================================================
values.local.yaml
values.local.yml
values-local.yaml
values.local.yaml.bak
overlays/*/values.local.yaml
overlays/*/values.local.yml
overlays/*/values-local.yaml
*.local.yaml
*.local.yml

# Never committed at any path, by name or by extension variant above.
# .example files are placeholders and are deliberately NOT matched by the
# patterns above (they end in .example, not .yaml/.yml), so they stay tracked.

# =============================================================================
# Pre-commit hook config: your own list of banned identifiers (real domain,
# registry host, node/cluster names). See .githooks/pre-commit and
# .githooks/banned-identifiers.local.txt.example.
# =============================================================================
.githooks/banned-identifiers.local.txt

# Claude Code workspace
.claude/

# Helm build artifacts
*.tgz

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
